/-!
# Table-Driven Interpretation `compI7003` for Receive-Path Regression Witnesses (`setup_seed = 7003`)

Defines the concrete table-driven `ExternInterpretation` `compI7003` shared by the two receive-path
synthetic mutant witnesses (`synthetic-decrypt-clone-not-persisted-cli` and
`synthetic-signal-msg-canonical-mac-cli`), both recorded at `setup_seed = 7003`.

Definitions only: no `sorry`, `axiom`, `opaque`, `extern`, `implemented_by`, or `native_decide`.
-/

@[expose] public section

set_option autoImplicit false
set_option maxRecDepth 200000

namespace Symbolic.BugInjection.Proofs.SyntheticRecvCommon.CompI7003

open CryptoProofLib.Refinement (ExternInterpretation ByteString)
